sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Candidate
  participant P as Candidate Portal
  participant D as Desktop Client
  participant B as Backend
  participant R as Recruiter Dashboard
  C->>P: Open interview link
  P->>D: Launch authorized client
  D->>B: Authenticate and register device
  B-->>D: JWT, session and policy
  D->>D: Start embedded browser
  loop Every 5 seconds
    D->>B: Send consented telemetry heartbeat
    B->>B: Persist and evaluate policy
    B-->>R: Stream status and violations
  end
  R->>B: Request final report
  B-->>R: Integrity score and timeline
